    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nExplore the code for this app. After each change, interact with the app to see how it impacted its functionality.\r\n\r\n1. **Change a starting value.** Find where the program sets the starting value for a variable. Change one of these values (for example: change `health = 20` to a different number, or change the `username`).\r\n\r\n2. **Change what the button does.** Find where the button changes the value of the health variable. Change how much it changes (for example: `change + 5` to `+ 10` or `- 1`).\r\n\r\n3. **Use text instead of a number.** Change the health variable's starting value to text instead of a number (for example: `let health = \"full\"`). What happens when you click the button?\r\n\r\n4. **Prevent a value from changing.** Change `let health` to `const health`. What happens when you click the button?\r\n\r\n5. **(Optional) Challenge.** Find the variable that controls the avatar image. Change the value to a different image in the `images` folder.",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "false"
  },
